real_s1  rows [4, 5, 29, 25]  The unit responds to vehicles (and some vehicle-like objects) seen in sharp focus, filling much of the frame, and especially when they face or point to the right, as in a side or three-quarter view. I
real_s2  rows [29, 4, 5, 25]  The unit responds to vehicles and vehicle-like machines (trucks, buses, cars, forklifts, plus parking meters and grilles) when the subject is sharply in focus, seen side-on and especially facing right
real_s3  rows [29, 4, 5, 25]  The unit responds to vehicles (cars, trucks, buses, and similar) shown in sharp, clear side or three-quarter views. It is most active when the subject faces or points to the right and is in focus, and
